      "heading": "",
      "text": "Accountability also needs accessible communication. A financial report can exist while members cannot obtain or understand its key information. Clear summaries, appropriate meeting arrangements and ways to raise concerns can make the reporting function more useful. Their value is judged through actual participation and response, rather than the number of pages produced.",
